  // === fee-impact ===
  "The Silent Wealth Killer: Investment Fees": "O impacto silencioso das taxas de investimento",
  "A difference of just 1% in annual investment fees can wipe out hundreds of thousands of dollars over a 30-year investing career due to the loss of compounding returns on those deducted fees.": "Uma diferença de apenas 1% nas taxas anuais pode drenar centenas de milhares de reais ao longo de uma vida de investimentos.",
  "Expense Ratios & Advisory Fees": "Taxas de administração e come-cotas",
  "The expense ratio is the annual percentage fee charged by mutual funds and ETFs for management and operations. When coupled with 1% wealth management AUM fees, total fee drag can easily exceed 1.5% to 2% annually.": "Fundos de investimento cobram taxas de administração e muitos possuem taxa de performance. Avalie o impacto sobre a rentabilidade líquida.",
  "Fee Drag Compounding Formula": "Cálculo do impacto das taxas compostas",
