  "Transfer accumulated cryptocurrency holdings into self-custody hardware wallets to eliminate third-party exchange counterparty risk.": "Transfira seus saldos de corretoras para uma hardware wallet pessoal (ex: Ledger ou Trezor) para eliminar riscos de custodiante.",
  // === tip ===
  "Dining & Service Tipping Etiquette": "Gorjetas e divisão da conta",
  "Tipping guidelines vary widely across hospitality sectors and geographic regions. Understanding tipping norms ensures fair compensation for service staff while avoiding overpaying.": "Os costumes sobre gorjeta variam pelo mundo: enquanto no Brasil os 10% são padrão opcional, em outros países a regra varia.",
  "North American Standards & Bill Splitting": "A taxa de 10% no Brasil e gorjetas internacionais",
  "In the United States and Canada, restaurant dining tipping standards range from 15% for adequate service, 18% for solid service, to 20% or more for outstanding service. Traditional etiquette recommends calculating tip percentages on the pre-tax food and beverage subtotal.": "No Brasil, a taxa de serviço de 10% a 13% costuma vir discriminada na conta como opcional; nos EUA, espera-se gorjeta de 18% a 20% sobre o subtotal.",
  "Split Bill Calculation": "Cálculo para rachar a conta",
