  // === discount ===
  "Calculating Sales Discounts, Markdowns & Final Costs": "Calculando descontos, liquidações e preço final",
  "Retail discounts, promotional coupon codes, and stacked clearance promotions can be confusing. Knowing how to calculate percentage savings and sales tax ensures you understand the true final checkout price.": "Promoções de Black Friday, cupons cumulativos e queimas de estoque podem enganar. Calcular o desconto real evita compras por impulso.",
  "Sequential vs. Additive Discounts": "Descontos sucessivos: cuidado com a soma falsa",
  "Retail stores frequently offer stacked promotions, such as 'Take 20% off, plus an extra 10% off at checkout'. These discounts are applied sequentially, not additively: a 20% discount followed by a 10% discount yields an effective total discount of 28%, not 30%.": "Um desconto de 20% com mais 10% no pagamento à vista não soma 30%! O segundo abatimento recai sobre o preço já reduzido, resultando em 28% reais.",
